---
description: Paired local governance with canonical NEXT
alwaysApply: true
---

Keep ROADMAP and HANDOVER consistent. `ok governance-sync` defaults to dry-run;
`--write` applies and commits locally on a clean feature branch. Request remote
enrichment/transport separately and only within authorization. Preserve canonical
NEXT; `--print-next` delegates to its validated reader. Offline remote freshness
is unknown. Muse realignment uses controlled mirror reconciliation, never export
into a live worktree. Refresh a successor explicitly with bound next-write and CAS.
